SUBENT        10030001   20200811   20210128   20210127       1472
BIB                 14         41
TITLE      Reaction cross sections of 85Rb(n,gamma)86Rb(m),
           87Rb(n,gamma)88Rb, and 89Y(n,gamma)90Y(m) between
           0.16 MeV and 1.5 MeV
AUTHOR     (N.D.Dudey,R.R.Heinrich,A.A.Madson)
REFERENCE  (J,JNE,24,181,1970)
           #doi:10.1016/0022-3107(70)90034-1
           (P,ANL-7450,105,1968) Preliminary results.
           (P,ANL-7575,170,1969) Subsequent preprint.
REL-REF    (M,10026001,N.D.Dudey+,J,JNE,23,443,1969) Irradiation
           conditions and flux monitoring techniques.
INSTITUTE  (1USAANL)
FACILITY   (VDG,1USAANL) 4-MeV Van de Graaff.
INC-SOURCE (P-LI7) Neutrons were produced by the 7Li(p,n)7Be
           reaction.
INC-SPECT  Energy resolution given is 1/2 full energy spread.
METHOD     (ACTIV) The targets were irradiated, disintegration
           rate was determined by counting gamma-rays. The
           neutron intensity was monitored both by a 235U
           fission counter and by gold foils sandwiching the
           targets.
MONITOR    (92-U-235(N,F),,SIG)    From BNL-325, Suppl.2 (1965)
           (79-AU-197(N,G)79-AU-198,,SIG)  Secondary standard.
           The neutron intensity was monitored both by a 235U
           fission counter and by gold foils sandwiching the
           targets.
MONIT-REF  (,J.R.Stehn+,R,BNL-325,(S2),1965)
CORRECTION Corrected for angular distribution of neutrons,
           second neutron group. Not corrected for neutron
           scattering or self-absorption (estimated less than
           2%). corrected gamma decay data for decay during
           counting time.
STATUS     (APRVD) Approved by author.
HISTORY    (19691219C)
           (19800723A) converted to reaction formalism
           (19990719A) converted to new date formats, lower case.
           (20120325A) SD: Page added to report in REFERENCE;
           ERR-ANALYS was updated in all Subents according to
           new EXFOR rules. Cosmetic changes in all subents.
           (20171114U) OS. Minor corr. in sub.1
           (20200811A) BP: Updated references, added doi,
           REL-REF, decay data.
ENDBIB              41
NOCOMMON             0          0
ENDSUBENT           44
